    "name": "Random Algorithms Arena",
    "title": "Layers that look like land",
    "lookup_name": "Random_Space",
    "description": "A finite sum of sine-based spatial functions at different scales. OCT selects the layer count, LAC changes frequency ratios and PER changes amplitude ratios. Seeded offsets, per-setting normalization and an earth-toned palette shape the picture without simulating landscape processes.",
